<title>USA: American ECO sets review after CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>American ECO sets review after CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>American ECO Corp said on Monday that it has asked its auditors, Karlins Fuller Arnold &amp; Klodosky LLP of Houston, Texas, to perform necessary accounting functions and to review its financial records following the resignation of its chief financial officer, John Walker.</p>
<p>The company did not say when or why Walker resigned. It said the auditors will conduct the review and handle accounting functions until a replacement is found.</p>
</text>
